{
  "_comment": "每個角色可寫入的路徑。CI 依此擋 PR。AGENTS.md 是給 Agent 看的請求,本檔是給你看的保證。",
  "_everyone": ["change-requests/"],
  "roles": {
    "architect": {
      "allow": ["contract/", "generated/"],
      "note": "唯一能改 API contract 與 DB migration 的角色"
    },
    "infra": {
      "allow": [
        ".github/",
        ".claude/",
        "scripts/",
        "CLAUDE.md",
        "package.json",
        "package-lock.json",
        "tsconfig.json",
        "backend/tsconfig.json",
        "frontend/tsconfig.json",
        "e2e/tsconfig.json",
        "Dockerfile",
        "docker-compose.yml",
        ".env.example",
        ".gitignore",
        ".gitattributes",
        "README.md",
        "AGENTS.md",
        "backend/AGENTS.md",
        "frontend/AGENTS.md",
        "infra/"
      ],
      "note": "規則的執行者。實作角色不得改動 CI,否則測試紅了可以直接把檢查拿掉。同理,AGENTS.md 由 infra 保管 —— 角色不得改寫自己被賦予的規則。"
    },
    "backend": {
      "allow": ["backend/src/"],
      "note": "不得改 contract、frontend、e2e"
    },
    "frontend": {
      "allow": ["frontend/src/"],
      "note": "不得改 contract、backend、e2e"
    },
    "qa": {
      "allow": ["e2e/"],
      "note": "只讀驗收條件與 contract,不讀實作"
    }
  }
}
